WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
It's mainly up to you to transport these things back.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,000
We are three to seven, you are seven and we are three

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,800
You agree on the rating before you go out. I won’t change the rules.

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,500
But you exerted so much strength and got 15 points

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,500
I'll compensate by getting an extra drone and some daily necessities.

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,400
At least for now, it seems these two people are trustworthy.

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:19,930
I miss you so much

8
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,130
Mom also wants to be silent

9
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,730
Although everything I do now is tiring

10
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,430
But they are all preparations for a crueler world in the future.

11
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,630
This time I will definitely survive with silence

12
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:51,330
Head east today and go farther away
